  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 044d079a85d2ad64ba07f77cd5e7969c, type: 3}
  dialogueContents:
  - Geez! Who are you?!
  - I live next door. Still in bed at this hour? Open the window!
  - I... I’m sick.
  - Oh... you gotta be real careful then. It’s not safe out here.
  - What do you mean not safe?
  - Some people... something bad happened. I can’t tell you.
  - What?! What do you mea---
  - Gotta go~
