  text2: {fileID: 1522}
  text3: {fileID: 1546}
  text1Contents:
  - How’s my little captain doing over here?
  - This is exhausted... your mom is scary!
  - What if she finds out?
  - Look, this's our little secret okay? You gotta keep it.
  - Brought you an awesome poster, happy birthday my son!
