  autoSteps:
  - delayTime: 4
    textN: DAD
    textD: Let me find a spot to put this up for you Liam.
  - delayTime: 4
    textN: MOM
    textD: Are you listening? Did you seriously not buy anything?
  - delayTime: 4
    textN: DAD
    textD: ...
  - delayTime: 1
    textN: MOM
    textD: I thought you were getting him wheelchair.
  - delayTime: 4
    textN: MOM
    textD: Eh..always bragging
  - delayTime: 3
    textN: MOM
    textD: Are you still part of this family or not?!
  - delayTime: 3
    textN: DAD
    textD: I’m here, I’m here!
  - delayTime: 2
    textN: MOM
    textD: Great
